        "pf_364b43ec_value": "Discover answers to common questions about the Canadian Protein Affiliate Program below. If you have more specific inquiries or need assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to our affiliate support team during business hours. We're here to help you make the most of your affiliate experience and boost your earnings! ",
